<title>USA: Central Vermont Public Svc bond rating cut.</title>
<headline>Central Vermont Public Svc bond rating cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Corp Tuesday downgraded Central Vermont Public Service Corp's first mortgage bonds to Triple-B from Triple-B-Plus.</p>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps also reaffirmed the utility's preferred stock rating of Triple-B-Minus.</p>
<p>Central Vermont's profile is weak when adjusted for long-term purchased power commitments, which makes up nearly 90 percent of the company's energy mix, said Duff &amp; Phelps.</p>
<p>Central Vermont provides electricity to half of the population of Vermont.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
